् follows.\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["खरि च ८.४.५५", "८.४.५५", "८.४.५५ खरि च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["Kari ca ८.४.५५", "८.४.५५", "८.४.५५ Kari ca"]}]}